/* The curated Master Quest set (port/include/port/master_quest.h, docs/MASTER_QUEST.md):
 * the text the challenge editor's "Start from the curated set" copies. */
"name Master Quest\n"
"# Paper Cut's curated Master Quest: the story's field fights remixed area by\n"
"# area from each area's own enemies, and their attacks given the game's own\n"
"# statuses. Balanced for a new file: the prologue and chapter 1 add an enemy or\n"
"# two and little else; from chapter 2 the fights mix their area's enemies and a\n"
"# few attacks gain a status; from chapter 4 most enemies have a little more HP;\n"
"# from chapter 7 the strongest hit one harder. The Pit of 100 Trials grows the\n"
"# same way floor by floor. Each fight's line is picked the same each time for\n"
"# a room, an enemy and the remix seed (Modes > Remix seed).\n"
"\n"
